// GPU settings preset: auto
//
// Cornerstone3D computes the texture edge and the texture memory for the
// device: a probe tests the texture edge, and the record of earlier loads sets
// the memory. A build of Cornerstone3D that has no `auto` preset reports the
// value as unknown, and keeps its own default preset.
//
// A preset applies only with final downsampling on, and a preset in this
// customization turns final downsampling on, also in a locked-down config.
// `?customization=` needs `customizationUrlPrefixes`, and config/default.js has
// none: there, set the preset through `customizationService` in the config.
//
// Load it with `?customization=gpu/auto`.
{
  "bootstrap": {
    "cornerstone.gpuSettingsPreset": "auto"
  }
}
